{"seq":3,"slug":"batch-mode-active","title":"批量主动学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/strategies/batch-mode-active","wordCount":1661,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"批量主动学习\">批量主动学习</h1><p>教科书里的主动学习每轮只挑一条样本、标注、立刻重训。这在逻辑回归上没问题，在深度神经网络上是灾难——重训一次要几小时，挑一条标一条重训一次，一万条样本要重训一万次，没人等得起。现实里你必须一次挑一批（几十到几千条），标完再重训。但这一改动引出一个朴素 top-k 解决不了的新问题：批内冗余。这一篇讲清批量为什么必要、朴素批量为什么失败、以及 BADGE 这类批量感知方法如何在一个空间里同时编码困惑与多样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>批量主动学习的核心矛盾是：单样本的「最有信息量」不等于一批样本的「整体最有信息量」。模型最不确定的 top-k 个样本往往彼此高度相似，它们的信息严重重叠——标了第一个，其余的边际价值就崩了。好的批量策略要挑「联合信息量」最大的一批，而非「各自信息量」最大的 k 个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[未标池打分] --&gt; B[朴素 top-k&lt;br/&gt;取分数最高的 k 个]&#10;  A --&gt; C[批量感知&lt;br/&gt;考虑批内联合信息]&#10;  B --&gt; D[问题: k 个挤在&lt;br/&gt;同一边界区域]&#10;  D --&gt; E[信息冗余&lt;br/&gt;有效标注量远小于 k]&#10;  C --&gt; F[BADGE: 梯度嵌入&lt;br/&gt;困惑度即向量长度&lt;br/&gt;多样性即向量方向]&#10;  C --&gt; G[BatchBALD&lt;br/&gt;联合互信息]&#10;  F --&gt; H[k-means++ 选多样种子]&#10;  G --&gt; I[贪心最大化联合 MI]\">flowchart TD\n  A[未标池打分] --&gt; B[朴素 top-k&lt;br/&gt;取分数最高的 k 个]\n  A --&gt; C[批量感知&lt;br/&gt;考虑批内联合信息]\n  B --&gt; D[问题: k 个挤在&lt;br/&gt;同一边界区域]\n  D --&gt; E[信息冗余&lt;br/&gt;有效标注量远小于 k]\n  C --&gt; F[BADGE: 梯度嵌入&lt;br/&gt;困惑度即向量长度&lt;br/&gt;多样性即向量方向]\n  C --&gt; G[BatchBALD&lt;br/&gt;联合互信息]\n  F --&gt; H[k-means++ 选多样种子]\n  G --&gt; I[贪心最大化联合 MI]</pre><p>下表对比朴素与批量感知方法的取舍。批量感知方法都在「单样本信息量」之外，额外约束「批内不重复」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>如何避免冗余</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素 top-k</td>\n<td>不避免（基线）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>仅作对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>top-k + core-set 过滤</td>\n<td>几何去重</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>通用首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BADGE</td>\n<td>梯度嵌入 + k-means++</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中等批量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BatchBALD</td>\n<td>联合互信息贪心</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>小批量、高价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"朴素-top-k-为什么失败\">朴素 top-k 为什么失败</h2><p>把不确定性采样直接搬到批量，就是取分数最高的 k 个。问题出在不确定性的空间分布上：模型最不确定的样本几乎都落在决策边界附近的同一块区域。设想一个二分类，边界是一条线，最不确定的样本就是贴着这条线的那一排——它们彼此近邻、近乎同一个样本的变体。</p>\n<p>后果可以量化：假设一批 100 个样本里只有 10 个是真正不同的「信息簇」，每簇 10 个近似重复，那么标完这 100 个，模型实际只学到了约 10 个样本的信息——有效标注效率只有 10%。预算白白浪费在重复样本上。这就是为什么 <a href=\"diversity-representativeness\">多样性与代表性</a> 不是锦上添花，而是批量场景的刚需。最简单的修补就是上一篇提到的两阶段过滤：先用不确定性筛一个大候选池，再用 core-set 在其中挑多样的 k 个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"badge-在梯度空间统一困惑与多样\">BADGE：在梯度空间统一困惑与多样</h2><p>BADGE（Batch Active learning by Diverse Gradient Embeddings）是 2026 年仍被广泛用作基线的优雅方法。它的洞见是：把每个样本编码成「假如它被标注，会在最后一层产生多大、什么方向的梯度」这个向量，那么困惑度和多样性就同时编码在了一个空间里——</p>\n<p>梯度向量的<strong>长度</strong>反映困惑度：模型越不确定的样本，假想梯度越大；梯度向量的<strong>方向</strong>反映样本类型：会推动模型朝不同方向更新的样本，方向不同。具体地，对样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，用模型当前对它的最可能预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为伪标签，算最后一层的损失梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_x = \\frac{\\partial \\, \\ell\\big(f(x), \\hat{y}\\big)}{\\partial \\, \\theta_{\\text{last}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.426em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>得到每个样本的梯度嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后，在这个嵌入空间里跑 k-means++ 初始化（一种倾向于挑彼此远离的种子的采样），挑出的 k 个种子就同时是高困惑（长向量）且多样（方向各异）的。一段话概括它的妙处：你不需要手动调和困惑与多样的权重，几何自然帮你做了——k-means++ 既偏好远点（多样），又因为长向量在距离里占主导而偏好高困惑点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batchbald-联合互信息的严谨解\">BatchBALD：联合互信息的严谨解</h2><p>BADGE 是启发式的，BatchBALD 则是 BALD 的严格批量推广。回忆 <a href=\"uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a> 里 BALD 挑「预测与参数互信息最大」的单个样本；BatchBALD 改为挑「一整批与参数的联合互信息最大」的子集：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>BatchBALD</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_{\\text{BatchBALD}}(\\{x_1,\\dots,x_k\\}) = \\mathrm{I}\\big(y_1,\\dots,y_k \\,;\\, \\theta\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">BatchBALD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键区别在「联合」：两个样本各自和参数互信息都很高，但如果它们提供的是同一份信息（冗余），联合互信息不会翻倍——这个公式天然惩罚冗余。问题是精确计算联合互信息要在所有标签组合上求和，复杂度随批量指数爆炸，所以实践用贪心：一个一个往批里加，每次加「在已选集合之外贡献最多新互信息」的样本。贪心因为联合互信息的子模性（submodularity）有近似保证。代价是即便贪心，BatchBALD 也比 BADGE 贵不少，适合小批量、高单标价值的场景（如医疗）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程上怎么选\">工程上怎么选</h2><p>批量大小本身是个要调的超参，且和成本-停止准则耦合：批太小则重训次数多、循环慢；批太大则一批内难免冗余、且反馈滞后。下面这张清单概括选型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的情况</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>想快速跑通、要基线</td>\n<td>朴素 top-k 起步，看效率是否够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现批内扎堆</td>\n<td>top-k + core-set 两阶段过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等批量、要稳健</td>\n<td>BADGE，免调困惑/多样权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小批量、单标极贵（专家）</td>\n<td>BatchBALD，联合互信息最严谨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>批量大小的取舍和整体预算分配密切相关，何时该停、每轮投多少，专门见 <a href=\"../practice/cost-stopping-criteria\">成本与停止准则</a>。批量挑出的样本接下来要进标注产线，产线的吞吐和批量大小也要匹配，见 <a href=\"../labeling-systems/annotation-workflows\">标注工作流与工具</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>深度学习里逐条挑样重训太贵，必须批量挑，但批量引入「批内冗余」新问题。</li>\n<li>朴素 top-k 把样本全挑在同一边界区域，有效标注效率可能只有名义的一小部分。</li>\n<li>BADGE 把样本编码成假想梯度向量：长度=困惑度、方向=多样性，用 k-means++ 一步挑出兼顾两者的批。</li>\n<li>BatchBALD 用联合互信息严格惩罚冗余，贪心求解，最严谨但最贵，适合小批量高价值场景。</li>\n<li>批量大小是耦合成本与循环速度的超参，选型从 top-k 起步按扎堆症状升级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"diversity-representativeness\">多样性与代表性</a>——批内去冗余的信号来源；<a href=\"../practice/cost-stopping-criteria\">成本与停止准则</a>——批量大小与预算的耦合。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../mlops-model-deployment/serving/scaling-inference\">扩展推理</a>——批量打分时的推理吞吐工程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批量主动学习","id":"批量主动学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"朴素 top-k 为什么失败","id":"朴素-top-k-为什么失败"},{"level":2,"text":"BADGE：在梯度空间统一困惑与多样","id":"badge-在梯度空间统一困惑与多样"},{"level":2,"text":"BatchBALD：联合互信息的严谨解","id":"batchbald-联合互信息的严谨解"},{"level":2,"text":"工程上怎么选","id":"工程上怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"多样性与代表性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/strategies/diversity-representativeness"},"next":{"title":"标注工作流与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/labeling-systems/annotation-workflows"}}